# UI & Design System Standards

You are strictly bound to the existing design system defined in this project. 

## 1. Styling Constraints
* **NEVER invent new hex codes, rgb values, or arbitrary pixel values.** * All colors, typography, spacing, and border-radii MUST be referenced from the `tailwind.config.ts` (or your specific css variables file).
* If a requested UI element requires a color or spacing not present in the configuration, you must STOP and ask me for the correct token name before proceeding.

## 2. Component Architecture
* Prioritize re-using existing components found in the `/components/ui` directory.
* Do not build a custom button, input, or card if a foundational component already exists. Import and compose them.